Package: BGCLM
Type: Package
Title: Bayesian Graphical Continuous Lyapunov Models
Version: 1.0
Date: 2026-09-22
Authors@R: person("Your", "Name", role = c("aut", "cre"), email =
         "your@email.com")
Description: MCMC for graphical continuous Lyapunov models with a
    spike-and-slab prior on the drift matrix. Observations are treated as
    equilibrium snapshots of a multivariate Ornstein-Uhlenbeck process, so
    the covariance solves a continuous Lyapunov equation. Stability of the
    drift is imposed through a Gershgorin diagonal. The sampler is written
    in C++ via RcppArmadillo.
